{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44705","headline":"送童子下山 · 金地藏","name":"送童子下山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"空门寂寞汝思家，礼别云房下九华。\n爱向竹栏骑竹马，懒於金地聚金沙。\n添瓶涧底休招月，烹茗瓯中罢弄花。\n好去不须频下泪，老僧相伴有烟霞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"金地藏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44705.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44705","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}